program	chain_assign_exclusivity_in_literal.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `w` is written by this optional-chain assignment while also being accessed in the right-hand side
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `w` is written by this optional-chain assignment while also being accessed in the right-hand side"
log	"  --> examples/chain_assign_exclusivity_in_literal.saw:32:6"
log	"     |"
log	" 32 |     w?.c = Cell(v: refill(&var w))"
log	"     |      ^"
log	"   hint: the right-hand side is evaluated first, so its writes through that borrow are overwritten by this assignment. Bind the value in its own statement, or borrow a disjoint path"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
